  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Famine prevention, Resilience and Livelihoods, and response enablers-WFP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the World Food Programme to prevent famine and improve food security through cash transfers or food assistance to meet the immediate needs of the most vulnerable people. Fund community-led resilience and livelihood activities aiming to improve household incomes and ability to adapt to the effects of climate change. Support the logistics and physical access to enable an effective humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
